    "description": "Be the First! Newly Reimagined 4BR/4BA Two-Level Flat over 2200 Sq. Ft. with Downtown Views & EV Parking\nEnjoy downtown views, generous living spaces, and a beautiful new interior in this thoughtfully redesigned, two-level Glen Park home.\nFeaturing four spacious bedrooms and four full bathrooms, the home includes an impressive penthouse primary suite occupying an entire floor\u2014a private retreat above it all.\nThe bright, open-concept great room offers a beautifully appointed kitchen with brand-new, top-of-the-line appliances and a breakfast area. An oversized separate room provides additional space for a living room or formal dining room. On the first level, a large family room offers flexibility for a home office, guest space, or additional bedroom.\nAdditional conveniences include:\n\u2022 In-unit laundry closet with a stacked washer and dryer\n\u2022 One-car garage parking\n\u2022 EV charging\n\u2022 Brand-new interior and a thoughtfully redesigned floor plan\nIdeally located near BART, bus stops, and the shops and restaurants of Glen Park Village, with convenient access to Sunnyside, Noe Valley, Bernal Heights, and the Mission. Highways 101 and 280 are just minutes away.\nWith spacious interiors, flexible living areas, and captivating downtown views, this exceptional home is ready for its first residents following a complete transformation.",
